  "question": {
    "text": "For a material medium, the values of refractive index for violet and red colours are given as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>1.56</mtext></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>1.44</mtext></math>. The dispersive power of a prism made out of this material is"
