  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Dispersive power of a prism is given as,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></msub><mo>&#8722;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>1.56</mtext><mo>&#8722;</mo><mtext>1.44</mtext></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>1.56</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>1.44</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mtext>0.24</mtext></math></p>"
